{"title":"Discover Card Tribute Award Scholarship","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Discover_Card_Tribute_Award_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Any current high school <i>junior</i> who:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Has at least a 2.75 cumulative grade point average on a 4.0 scale for 9th and 10th grades</li>\n<li>Demonstrates accomplishments in community service and leadership and has faced a significant roadblock or challenge</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Amount\">Amount</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Discover_Card_Tribute_Award_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Amount\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Up to 10 scholarships of \\$40,000 each\n</p><p>For more information, check out the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.discoverfinancial.com/community/\">website</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Discover_Card_Tribute_Award_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=National_scholarships\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"National scholarships\">National scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018082744\n